`log(log Z_n) = o(n)`. The seed probability then has zero exponential cost. -/
theorem tendsto_neg_log_practicalSeedTiltProbability_div
    (Z : ℕ → ℕ) (P : ℕ → Finset ℕ)
    (hP : ∀ n p, p ∈ P n → p.Prime) {lam : ℝ} (hlam : 1 ≤ lam)
    (hZ : ∀ᶠ n in atTop, 210 < Z n)
    (hB : ∀ᶠ n in atTop, practicalSeedPrimeUniverse (seedWindowCount (Z n)) ⊆ P n)
