probability bounded by a constant times `(h+1)/a`. -/
theorem primeLogMark_smallBall {a u h : ℝ} (ha : log 2 ≤ a)
    (hlarge : 4 * mertensErrorConstant ≤ a * log 2) (hh : 0 ≤ h) :
    (∑ p ∈ (primeLogWindow a (2 * a)).filter (fun p : ℕ ↦ |log (p : ℝ) - u| ≤ h),
